{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>汀九橋發生跳橋案。今日（21日）凌晨1時許，一輛黑色七人車沿汀九橋往屯門方向行駛，其間一名年約35歲男司機下車跳橋，青馬管制區職員得知事件，立即報警。消防和水警接報到場，事主陷入昏迷，由水警救起，由救護車送往仁濟醫院進行搶救。</p><p>就現場所見，涉事七人車仍然停泊上址，警員在場調查；據了解，車內沒有遺書。</p><figure><img alt=\"男司機離開黑色七人車後跳橋，警方在場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189401294830702592245381.jpeg/sudA132qzFJBSHyGEhtScYGOsfqtIxSbYx1LJlkdSyY\"/><figcaption>男司機離開黑色七人車後跳橋，警方在場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男司機離開黑色七人車後跳橋，警方在場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189401290388803584726918.jpeg/1HMrpTpJQUBR_fgXOzsxjsgn7SrAS2L7i0b987FG_fM\"/><figcaption>男司機離開黑色七人車後跳橋，警方在場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男司機離開黑色七人車後跳橋，警方在場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189401286160814080568730.jpeg/MOyQXszTFPLzvdPm8ldgZkyh09jw1A_48bpr78u6a-8\"/><figcaption>男司機離開黑色七人車後跳橋，警方在場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員到場救人。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189401282163511296482195.jpeg/yNY-IcanDJJjVB58E6xzRQGqh-31w58_zhZptvQWabY\"/><figcaption>救援人員到場救人。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T18:59:33.511807+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":250,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:53:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:52:38.441659+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.775553+00:00","content_hash":"49003b9820659e0d5de74ac5f301416f88d101a22555d82eb8e1354d3decd94b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}